EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

To apply for temporary loan modification, please send the following:


 - {!Case.Last_Month__c} bank statement
 - {!Case.Current_Month__c} month to date bank transaction history


Please answer the following questions:


Why the need for modification?
When will you be able to resume payment?
When will you be able to catch up missed payment?

*all missed payments will require a catchup plan to be setup within 1 month of payment resuming*


Once received, I will submit to a credit manager with your request to temporarily modify payment.


Please call me with any questions.



Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
